The Generic Root-to-Leaf Template

This is worth memorizing:

void dfs(TreeNode root, StringBuilder path,
         List<String> result) {

    if (root == null) {
        return;
    }

    // choose
    int oldLength = path.length();
    path.append(root.val);

    // leaf → record answer
    if (root.left == null && root.right == null) {
        result.add(path.toString());
    } else {

        // explore
        path.append("->");

        dfs(root.left, path, result);
        dfs(root.right, path, result);
    }

    // undo
    path.setLength(oldLength);
}

The pattern is:

Choose
  ↓
Explore
  ↓
Record at leaf
  ↓
Undo
